# KIPPER: the Blackwater is black but for a few pixels round the sub; the
# Lamp lights a circle. The radar shows big ones nearby; with the Sonar it
# also shows pick-ups, hidden ones too, and big ones anywhere in the area on
# its rim.
seed 1
game kipper
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat clear
cheat calm
cheat tile 50 115
wait 30
expect ink_view > 40000
cheat fit 6
wait 2
expect ink_view < 30000
# the radar: Gnasher close by is a red dot; items are not shown without the Sonar
cheat tile 98 18
wait 2
expect radar_yellow == 0
cheat fit 7
wait 2
expect radar_yellow > 0
